 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : CBTRN02C.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS Batch PL/I Program (BMP)                        */
 /* Function    : Daily Transaction Posting                           */
 /* Converted from COBOL batch: app/cbl/CBTRN02C.cbl                 */
 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.                     */
 /* All Rights Reserved.                                              */
